{"id":65232,"date":"2026-08-30T12:01:52","date_gmt":"2026-08-30T11:01:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=65232"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:40:16","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:40:16","slug":"sao-silvestre-aveiro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-aveiro\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre Aveiro 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Aveiro 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Aveiro 2026<\/strong> (Civilria RunClub S\u00e3o Silvestre de Aveiro) realiza-se no dia <strong>28 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> na encantadora cidade dos canais, concelho e distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Sendo uma das primeiras grandes corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre da \u00e9poca festiva em Portugal, a prova ilumina as art\u00e9rias centrais da cidade com milhares de atletas numa atmosfera vibrante de celebra\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 assegurada pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Aveiro<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>NT Wellness Sports Solutions<\/strong> e suporte t\u00e9cnico da <strong>Lap2Go<\/strong>, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o junto ao <strong>Centro de Congressos de Aveiro<\/strong>. O programa inicia-se \u00e0s <strong>17:15<\/strong> com a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de lazer, dando lugar \u00e0s <strong>18:30<\/strong> ao arranque da competitiva <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> devidamente cronometrada por chip eletr\u00f3nico.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">28 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 17:15<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; bo